cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the ArcticQA dataset or the ArcticAbstain responses, please cite the paper below."
title: "Arctic Questions, Missing Answers: code and data for the ArcticQA dataset and the ArcticAbstain benchmark"
abstract: >-
  ArcticQA is a dataset of 194 multiple-choice questions built from primary
  Arctic research papers, with automated checks of answer support and
  distractor contradiction against source evidence. ArcticAbstain pairs each
  question in an answer-present and an answer-absent condition, both with an
  explicit abstention option. This repository holds the construction pipeline,
  the evaluation code, the 9,312 recorded responses of eight models, and the
  analysis that reproduces the paper tables. The items are machine-accepted and
  not expert-verified.
type: software
